{"id": "nt-translate-058", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Минулої суботи в парку біля річки волонтери висадили сорок молодих лип. Мешканці приносили лопати й воду.", "does": "", "gold": "Last Saturday, volunteers planted forty young linden trees in the park by the river. Residents brought shovels and water.", "wrong": "Volunteers planted trees.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["saturday"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["volunteer"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["forty", "40"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["linden", "lime"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["shovel", "spade"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-059", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Наш потяг затримався на годину. Ми встигли випити кави й купити газету на вокзалі.", "does": "", "gold": "Our train was delayed by an hour. We had time to drink coffee and buy a newspaper at the station.", "wrong": "The train was on time.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["train"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["delay", "late"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["hour"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["coffee"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["newspaper"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-060", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Будинок культури шукає керівника дитячого хору. Заняття відбуваються тричі на тиждень увечері.", "does": "", "gold": "The house of culture is looking for a leader of a children's choir. Classes take place three times a week in the evening.", "wrong": "We need a singer.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["culture", "community", "cultural"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["choir"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["three times", "3 times", "thrice"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["evening"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-061", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Восени ми збираємо гриби в лісі за селом. Дідусь знає всі грибні місця.", "does": "", "gold": "In autumn we pick mushrooms in the forest behind the village. Grandpa knows all the mushroom spots.", "wrong": "We go to the forest.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["autumn", "fall"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["mushroom"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["forest", "wood"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["village"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["grand"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-062", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади українською: \"The festival starts on Friday evening. Entry is free, but you need to register online.\"", "does": "", "gold": "Фестиваль починається в п'ятницю ввечері. Вхід вільний, але треба зареєструватися онлайн.", "wrong": "Фестиваль буде.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["фестивал"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["п'ятниц", "пʼятниц", "п’ятниц"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["вхід", "безкоштов"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["реєстр", "зареєстр"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-063", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади українською: \"Our cat is afraid of the vacuum cleaner. Every time we clean, she hides under the bed.\"", "does": "", "gold": "Наша кішка боїться пилососа. Щоразу, коли ми прибираємо, вона ховається під ліжком.", "wrong": "Кішка спить.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["кіш", "кіт", "кот"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["пилосос"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["хова"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["ліжк"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-064", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади українською: \"The road to the village was repaired last summer. Now the bus comes twice a day.\"", "does": "", "gold": "Дорогу до села відремонтували минулого літа. Тепер автобус приїжджає двічі на день.", "wrong": "Дорогу відремонтували.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["дорог"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["сел"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["літ"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["автобус"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["двічі", "два рази", "2 рази"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-065", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "root", "prompt": "Переклади українською: \"Please do not feed the ducks with bread. It makes them sick.\"", "does": "", "gold": "Будь ласка, не годуйте качок хлібом. Від нього вони хворіють.", "wrong": "Годуйте качок.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["не год"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["кач"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["хліб"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["хвор", "шкодить", "погано"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-066", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Шановні батьки! Екскурсію перенесено на п'ятницю. Збір о 14:30 біля школи.", "does": "", "gold": "Dear parents! The excursion has been moved to Friday. Meeting at 14:30 by the school.", "wrong": "Dear parents, the trip is cancelled.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["parent"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["friday"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["14:30", "2:30", "half past two"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["school"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-067", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Повідомляю, що завтра не зможу вийти на роботу у зв'язку з хворобою. Медичну довідку надам у понеділок.", "does": "", "gold": "I would like to inform you that I will not be able to come to work tomorrow due to illness. I will provide a medical certificate on Monday.", "wrong": "I am at work.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["tomorrow"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["work"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["ill", "sick"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["monday"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-068", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: У суботу волонтери з допомогою мешканців висадили в парку сорок лип. Навесні вони планують посадити бузок.", "does": "", "gold": "On Saturday, volunteers with the help of residents planted forty lindens in the park. In spring they plan to plant lilacs.", "wrong": "Volunteers worked.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["saturday"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["forty", "40"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["park"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["lilac"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-069", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a short paragraph", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади українською: \"Dear residents, the water will be turned off on Saturday from 10 a.m. to 2 p.m. We apologise for the inconvenience.\"", "does": "", "gold": "Шановні мешканці, у суботу з 10:00 до 14:00 не буде води. Перепрошуємо за незручності.", "wrong": "Води не буде.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["мешкан"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["субот"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["вод"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["незручн", "перепрош", "вибач"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-070", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Разом за квитки треба заплатити 1 350 гривень, забрати їх можна в касі до 18:00.", "does": "", "gold": "In total, you need to pay 1,350 hryvnias for the tickets; you can pick them up at the box office until 18:00.", "wrong": "Tickets cost money.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["ticket"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["18:00", "6 p.m", "6 pm", "6:00 pm", "six"]}, {"type": "has_number", "value": 1350, "tolerance": 0.01}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-071", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Вистава закінчиться о 21:15, а гардероб працює ще пів години.", "does": "", "gold": "The performance will end at 21:15, and the cloakroom stays open for another half hour.", "wrong": "The show ends late.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["21:15", "9:15"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["cloakroom", "coat check", "wardrobe"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["half", "30 min"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-072", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Кожен учень має заплатити 450 гривень за екскурсію.", "does": "", "gold": "Each student has to pay 450 hryvnias for the excursion.", "wrong": "Students pay.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["student", "pupil"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["excursion", "trip", "tour"]}, {"type": "has_number", "value": 450, "tolerance": 0.01}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-073", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Потяг прибуває до Києва о 07:50, на дев'яту платформу.", "does": "", "gold": "The train arrives in Kyiv at 07:50, at platform nine.", "wrong": "The train is late.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["train"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["kyiv", "kiev"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["7:50"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["nine", "9"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-074", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Після знижки куртка коштує 1 620 гривень.", "does": "", "gold": "After the discount, the jacket costs 1,620 hryvnias.", "wrong": "The jacket is cheap.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["discount"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["jacket"]}, {"type": "has_number", "value": 1620, "tolerance": 0.01}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-075", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: На рахунку залишилося 1 610 гривень після оплати інтернету й телефону.", "does": "", "gold": "1,610 hryvnias remained on the account after paying for the internet and phone.", "wrong": "The account is empty.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["account"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["internet"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["phone"]}, {"type": "has_number", "value": 1610, "tolerance": 0.01}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-076", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Нарада почнеться о 13:40 і триватиме 1 годину 35 хвилин.", "does": "", "gold": "The meeting will start at 13:40 and will last 1 hour 35 minutes.", "wrong": "The meeting is long.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["meeting"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["13:40", "1:40"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["35"]}]}}
{"id": "nt-translate-077", "split": "train", "bucket": "translate", "skill": "translate", "label": "translate", "subtype": "a sentence with numbers and times", "form": "with previous value", "prompt": "Переклади англійською: Загальна вага речей — 4,9 кілограма.", "does": "", "gold": "The total weight of the items is 4.9 kilograms.", "wrong": "The bag is heavy.", "check": {"type": "all", "rubrics": [{"type": "contains_any", "values": ["weight"]}, {"type": "contains_any", "values": ["kilogram", "kg"]}, {"type": "has_number", "value": 4.9, "tolerance": 0.01}]}}
